+"""Frontier interchange (card B3), the training side: frontier.Frontier (source pass + slice write at layer L), the
+trainer seams of scripts/train_student.py (--b3-arm) and the readout. CPU, the tiny random Qwen3.5 text model (8 layers,
+hidden 64) with the GPT-2 tokenizer, as tests/test_depth_forcing.py. Checks: the write puts exactly the source's slice
+at the receiver's positions and changes nothing else; checkpointing on (reentrant and non-reentrant) equals off with the
+hook active; the gradient reaches the receiver's layers and, only with --b3-source-grad, the source's; the loss of a
+mixed micro-batch is kl_loss's (pads at weight 0 contribute nothing); 30 steps on 8 fixed receiver / source pairs make
+the intervened forward pick the counterfactual letter while the plain CE still falls; the readout reports cf11 / same;
+FSDP2 at world 1 with the hook; the trainer end to end per arm (subprocess) with its metrics block; the flag-off path
+byte-identical to src_df's (COTD_REF_REPO); flag validation."""
